# Every image builds from the repository root (server/Dockerfile, web/Dockerfile), and needs only these.
# Everything else, the build folders above all, would make every build send gigabytes and miss the cache.
*
!CMakeLists.txt
!CMakePresets.json
!vcpkg.json
!core
!render
!server
!web
core/tests
core/fuzz
server/tests
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/src/wasm
web/test-results
web/playwright-report
